  "post_content": "<p>Una treintena de personas, pertenecientes a la asociaci&oacute;n cultural ecuestre Aires Nuevos, participaron ayer s&aacute;bado en la romer&iacute;a a caballo, que recorri&oacute; algunas calles de Onda, tras el almuerzo que disfrutaron en el Recinto Multiusos. Despu&eacute;s, a trav&eacute;s de caminos, llegaron hasta el restaurante El Riu, donde celebraron una comida de herrmandad hasta media tarde.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriaacaballoonda/img_5031.jpg\" alt=\"img_5031\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriaacaballoonda/img_5032.jpg\" alt=\"img_5032\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriaacaballoonda/img_5033.jpg\" alt=\"img_5033\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriaacaballoonda/img_5034.jpg\" alt=\"img_5034\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriaacaballoonda/img_5035.jpg\" alt=\"img_5035\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriaacaballoonda/img_5036.jpg\" alt=\"img_5036\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriaacaballoonda/img_5037.jpg\" alt=\"img_5037\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriaacaballoonda/img_5038.jpg\" alt=\"img_5038\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriaacaballoonda/img_5039.jpg\" alt=\"img_5039\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriaacaballoonda/img_50